    injectionType: "Direct Injection (Features a highly advanced Bosch high-pressure system operating at 250 bar. The Piezo injectors optimize spray, providing phenomenal fuel atomization but guaranteeing severe intake valve carbon buildup. Professional Walnut Blasting is required every 60,000 to 80,000 miles to restore airflow and prevent misfires. The High-Pressure Fuel Pump is highly sensitive to varying ethanol blends found in US fuels.)",
    engineLifespan: "150,000+ miles (The mechanical core is an exceptionally robust die-cast aluminum block featuring Nanoslide bore spray coating. Because the US-spec A 250 uses the native 221hp mapping, the internals are operating perfectly within design limits. Lifespan is dictated entirely by auxiliary components: the rear timing chain, thermal management module, and 7G-DCT transmission.)",
    turboType: "Turbocharged (Equipped with a responsive twin-scroll turbocharger featuring an electronic wastegate actuator. The twin-scroll design perfectly separates exhaust pulses, drastically reducing turbo lag. The mechanical linkage rod connecting the actuator to the wastegate flap wears out over time due to intense heat cycling, causing a metallic rattling sound.)",
