      { label: "Tailgate & Door Seams", x: 0.09, y: -0.11, z: -0.44, critical: false, details: "MAINTENANCE POINT: The W245 is notorious for severe surface rust forming along the bottom edges of the doors and the tailgate lip due to poor factory seam sealing." }
