    maxPowerStockInternals: "220 - 230 hp (The internal rotating assembly handles power effortlessly, but the 8-valve cylinder head limits top-end breathing. A Stage 1 flash adds roughly 30 horsepower and significantly boosts torque. However, pushing this engine is incredibly risky if paired with the Autotronic CVT, as 280 Nm is already the absolute physical limit of the CVT push-belt.)",
