      "Cylinder Head Destruction ('Black Death'): If injector seal leaks are ignored for too long, the injectors become permanently cemented into the head by hardened carbon. Attempting to remove them often snaps the injector or cracks the cylinder head.",
      "Economic Total Loss (CVT Failure): Neglecting the Autotronic 722.8 fluid changes will relentlessly destroy the internal steel push-belt and the variator cones. A full CVT rebuild easily costs upwards of 2,500 EUR, making manual transmission models vastly superior.",
